<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.11%			 O/N = 2.55% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.55%			 T/N = Par</p>
<p>		   Nov 6, 1996			  Nov 5, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.72%	1 month forward =  1.70%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  4.08%	2 month forward =  3.24%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.22%	3 month forward =  4.65%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.88%	4 month forward =  5.28%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.47%	5 month forward =  5.87%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.44%	6 month forward =  5.90%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
